  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Healthcare for 20,000 people in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In response to the conflict in Ukraine, Medicos del Mundo (Doctors of the World) is supporting the Healthcare System, working with the affected health centers and hospitals by providing medicines and attending physical and mental health. We use mobile clinics to reach older and isolated people. We intend to continue giving healthcare to 20,000 people in the Eastern area. Doctors of the World has been present in Ukraine since 2014, that gives us the know-how for a rapid and efective response.</narrative>
  </description>
